# Gate Colossus: "Affinity for Gates" - {8} less {1} for each Gate you control. Bot1 plays Talon Gates of Madara (a Gate,
# its own trigger has no creature to target) and taps Black Lotus and four Moxen for exactly seven mana: Gate Colossus
# resolves, the pool is empty and the Gate is still untapped, so nothing but the discount paid for the eighth mana.
# (The control, with no Gate, is the other cost scenario: it costs the full eight.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Talon Gates of Madara
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Gate Colossus
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Talon Gates of Madara.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gate Colossus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Talon Gates of Madara; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire; Gate Colossus
Bot1.Battlefield.Talon Gates of Madara.Tapped = false
